The "natural" response to a problem of the simple sort imagined here is rep=
etition with added stress: 'so'E', which falls within this scheme.  There a=
re harder cases where this is not enough (and even this breaks the strict w=
ritten-spoken isomorphy).  But looking for fixes is a reasonable approach, =
given that prevention is no longer an option.  And, of course, the problem =
is still pretty remote.

